{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0334_1000_p", "source_sha256": "579998c4fed91cb8a541cd76c034b947d13aeb15af064bcf2995cbe54ad5ca68", "ja": "（今日はこれから美也のPV撮影だ！\n天気にも恵まれて、準備は順調に進んでいる……）", "zh": "（今天接下来要拍美也的PV！天气也很不错，准备工作进展得很顺利……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0334_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "1014a648852bc54d48e638d3846a5e69e71cd42b82756a321b61694754ecacf1", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです～。\nポカポカ陽気で、ひなたぼっこ日和ですな～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了～\n天气暖洋洋的，真是个晒太阳的好日子呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0334_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5db977e027246979e84030c4f17c3ddcaf7253aeee27fca81bf2638961321960", "ja": "ああ。昼寝をしたら気持ちいいだろうな……。\nでもその前に！　まずは撮影を頑張らないとな。", "zh": "啊啊。睡个午觉一定很舒服吧……。\n不过在那之前！首先得努力完成拍摄才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0334_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "62e047f818fdeffdaa25738cdbbd803de42e953415cb6b4dfa83188dbd0b7e2c", "ja": "そうですね～。では、撮影が終わったら、\n一緒にひなたぼっこをしましょう～。", "zh": "是啊～那么，拍摄结束后，我们一起晒晒太阳吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0334_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "7cebc7adae47a73ec94f4b64cde3acc1a86c32306d7a9bfa79bfbb63f682b7ad", "ja": "あ、そういえば小さい頃は、おじいちゃんと一緒に\n縁側で、よくひなたぼっこをしてました～。", "zh": "啊，说起来，我小时候也经常和爷爷一起在廊檐下晒太阳呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0334_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e177a9661ef6c8a3835520968d47c1fd4708ee1b2a2129a2db56d4c320f76ad5", "ja": "ははっ。なんだかほっこりする話だな。\n美也は、おじいさんが大好きなんだな。", "zh": "哈哈，听起来真是个温馨的故事啊。\n美也很喜欢爷爷呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0334_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "28647bdccb4e48c74319ff74adc9c38692d56b743d3f94a98da2f777e01aeb8c", "ja": "はい～。ほかにも、囲碁や将棋を教えてもらったり、\n肩を揉んであげたり……一緒にいると楽しいんです～。", "zh": "是呀～此外，我还跟爷爷学下围棋和将棋，也会帮他揉肩……和他待在一起很开心～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0334_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "1f17d376478062ca48018cd6b3ec09e160df20f6da2bf03adcb0356c2ab82f77", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、\nおじいちゃんに会ったら、大好きになると思います～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生见到爷爷后，也一定会喜欢上他的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0334_1008_p", "source_sha256": "aa83f07b130e0b2af20457e61386b9960e8ea3f4f1e9cc120fca79d34046bee7", "ja": "そうか。じゃあ、いつかご挨拶にいかないと。\n美也のおじいさんが、どんな人か会うのが楽しみだ！", "zh": "这样啊。那以后有机会一定得去拜访一下。真期待见见美也的爷爷，看看他是个什么样的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0334_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "84be57eff964191849b783bc2981e3919fc8630dac01d034d8fa2ee3c04c1709", "ja": "どんな人ですか……そうですね～。おじいちゃんは、\nちょっとだけ不思議なところがあるんです～。", "zh": "是个什么样的人……这个嘛～我爷爷有一点点不可思议的地方呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0334_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "a8df351a3128e0d25c76a40c62f1347a5eb0e8e95dc6bc7989072ca4dbe8db67", "ja": "天気が悪い日も寒い日も、おじいちゃんのそばにいると\n体も心もポカポカしてくるんです。不思議ですな～。", "zh": "不管是天气不好的日子还是寒冷的日子，只要待在爷爷身边，\n身体和心里就会变得暖洋洋的。真是不可思议呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0334_1011_p", "source_sha256": "256913a7a9c11a7581dd45ddf8bd0a5f235a2ce920d4ef68f2c1b0f15a6ded13", "ja": "なるほど……。でも、どうしてそうなるのかは、\nなんとなく想像がつくよ。", "zh": "原来如此……不过，我大概能猜到为什么会这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0334_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "2bca7fdade93f5e58a5788b221dd4bbbdde63088bf2349243c4d5d82c1dbb59e", "ja": "なんと～。さすが{$P$}さんです～。\n私はどうしてなのか、全然わかりませんでした……。", "zh": "哎呀～不愧是{$P$}先生呢～。我完全不知道为什么会这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0334_1013_p", "source_sha256": "bb6c58187af4f91f381ac3e10dfd4fe2c7f0ba21e9f1b200fd7cce1d74ac7ffb", "ja": "多分、おじいさんも同じなんだと思うよ。大好きな\n美也と一緒にいてポカポカして、それが伝わって……。", "zh": "大概你爷爷也是一样的心情吧。和最喜欢的\n美也在一起心里暖洋洋的，那份温暖也传了过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0334_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "271da8ec7da78cb3c7ec702b5b0813d441665a028e7240969f28f858446098b5", "ja": "なるほど～。おじいちゃんのポカポカの原因は、\n私でしたか～。全然気づきませんでしたな～。", "zh": "原来如此～。爷爷心里暖洋洋的原因，就是我吗～。完全没注意到呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0334_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "990834e453ee861a400542c1cde0ed138ccfbe70c5736a1f20c8b1282c863169", "ja": "でも大好きな人といると、心がポカポカしてくる……。\nとっても素敵な現象ですね～。……あ、それなら。", "zh": "不过，和最喜欢的人待在一起，心里就会暖洋洋的……  \n真是非常美妙的现象呢～。……啊，这样的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0334_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "e394bd7f20715c0eab790851662592ee08c1f0b4fd5c58ce5d84af8b6dbef0f4", "ja": "ファンのみなさんを、もっとポカポカにすることも\nできそうですけど……どうしたらいいでしょう～？", "zh": "要是能让各位粉丝也更加暖洋洋的……  \n可是，要怎么做才好呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0334_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ed2c27a8eded8c58e92fb1693a00652c7730f38f87fa8747dacc10fa5d9d890e", "ja": "それなら簡単だ！　美也がファンのことを思っていれば\nすぐにでも伝わるはずだよ。", "zh": "那很简单！只要美也心里想着粉丝们，这份心意应该马上就能传达给他们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0334_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "f3647e29092816af59ff85430f6ab0d6963b08f514d8fcb424def072f94d359f", "ja": "おお～。それなら、すぐできますね。このPVで、\nファンのみなさんをポカポカにしてみせましょう～♪", "zh": "哦哦～这样的话，很快就能做到呢。就用这支PV，让粉丝们的心里暖洋洋的吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0334_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "c0367e3a923825766ec1b60ed80af1b22252cd8b5396fa431f8f9c070320f4b5", "ja": "もちろん、{$P$}さんのことも……。\nふふっ。ちゃんと、そばで見ててくださいね～。", "zh": "当然也少不了{$P$}先生……  \n呵呵，请好好地在旁边看着哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
